 ## Evidence limits
 
 This section establishes a reviewable attack contract and a reproducible paper review of it at one base. It establishes no runtime. No descriptor named here has been resolved, no query named here has been issued, no outcome named here has been drawn, no telegraph named here has been drawn, and no parameter named here has been measured. A specified ordering rule is not an enforced ordering rule, and a paper comparison of two consumers is not a demonstration that an implementation feeds them the same bytes.
